# Placeholder htpasswd file for the local Docker registry (registry service
# in docker-compose.yml). Generate a real one before first `docker compose up`
# by running ./generate-secrets.sh from this directory, or manually with:
#
#   docker run --rm httpd:2.4-alpine htpasswd -Bbn <user> <password> > auth.htpasswd
#
# This file is required for the registry service to start — it will fail to
# boot with an empty/missing file. Never commit real credentials here.
